AYE SHAME GHAREBAAN<br>
Din dhal gaya ashoor ka tareek shab thi<br>
Bikhre huwe lashe the har simt udasi<br>
Deti huwe pehra kaha Binte Ali ne<br>
<br>
Kya tujh se kahen haal-e-digar Zainab-e-Muztar &ndash; Aye Sham-e-Gharebaan<br>
Jati hoon luta kar teri goodi mein bhara ghar &ndash; Aye Sham-e-Gharebaan<br>
<br>
Akber ki azaan se huwa aghaaz wo din ka &ndash; Phatta tha kaleja<br>
Shabbir se bas jung ko tayyaar tha lashkar &ndash; Aye Sham-e-Gharebaan<br>
<br>
Kaise mein kahun tujh se wo sab karb ke manzar &ndash; Karbal ki zameen par<br>
Thi khoon mein doobi huwe Aulaad-e-Payamber &ndash; Aye Sham-e-Gharebaan<br>
<br>
Zaqmon se bhare Aon-o-Mohammed ke janaze &ndash; Khaime mein jo aaye<br>
Sab Ahle Haram dekh ke rote the tadap kar &ndash; Aye Sham-e-Gharebaan<br>
<br>
Shabbir ki dukhtar bani chand lamhon mein bewa &ndash; Kaisa wo samaa tha<br>
Sheh late the Qasim ke sabhi tukde utha kar &ndash; Aye Sham-e-Gharebaan<br>
<br>
Akber ke janaze ko ek baap ne dekha &ndash; Seene mein tha bhala<br>
Ghode se gire khak pe ye dekh ke manzar &ndash; Aye Sham-e-Gharebaan<br>
<br>
Abbas-e-Alamdar ke kate gaye shane &ndash; Darya ke kanare<br>
The nale kuna tooti kamar tham ke Sarwar &ndash; Aye Sham-e-Gharebaan<br>
<br>
Narghe mein layeenon ke tha bhaye mera tanha &ndash; Seh roz ka pyasa<br>
Faryaad mein karti rahi chalta raha khanjar &ndash; Aye Sham-e-Gharebaan<br>
<br>
Tha ghoor andhera aye Sohail us ghadi ban mein &ndash; Sannata tha run mein<br>
Har baar yehi bain the Zainab ke labon par &ndash; Aye Sham-e-Gharebaan
